@webAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get All Products
GET {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Warehouses
GET {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/warehouses
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get All Suppliers
GET {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### 4. AI Inventory Data Extraction (Example Test Case 1)
POST {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/ai-extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Receive 20 boxes of Product A from Supplier X into Binh Tan Warehouse."
}

### 5. Confirm Transaction
POST {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionType": "Receive",
  "productId": 1,
  "supplierId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 20
}

### 6. Get Transaction History
GET {{webAPI_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/history
Accept: application/json
